<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xml:lang="en" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="UFO"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Ufo"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Ufo (Explicit)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="CupcakKe"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="cupcakKe"/><amll:meta key="album" value="The BakKery"/><amll:meta key="album" value="The BakKery (Explicit)"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2756650812"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="611161030"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="0028ud4p3Yyhjj"/><amll:meta key="spotifyId" value="391JuvUeHAcN8lQEU56ktO"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1846990921"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="QT6622538215"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="39523898"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="250306205"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Steve-xmh"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="kid141252010"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>Elizabeth Harris</songwriter></songwriters><translations><translation xml:lang="zh-Hans" type="subtitle"><text for="L5">得要它，要到手，亲自去感受</text><text for="L6">狠狠干，姐可不打算拱手让人</text><text for="L7">姐的贝塔可素城里的天花板</text><text for="L8">那标价才两位数的婊子们只能乖乖就范</text><text for="L9">人人都想来尝，你的人却口嫌体正</text><text for="L10">想打个桩，想舔个够，像施了魔法一样狠狠干</text><text for="L11">就留在里面，像他完事贝塔也不带松的</text><text for="L12">二十分钟的份一分钟就把持不住了</text><text for="L13">钱不到账，他立马破防</text><text for="L14">得像野餐一样，把他死死套住</text><text for="L15">想拍成人电影，这身段天生适合 <span ttm:role="x-bg">(啊~)</span></text><text for="L16">他来得太快，只配拍个预告 <span ttm:role="x-bg">(呀~)</span></text><text for="L17">要是没钱，别指望我取悦你</text><text for="L18">这贝塔可是外星级别，你此生难再遇</text><text for="L19">可要是他真有钞票成堆 堆 堆</text><text for="L20">那姐就给他 舔 舔 舔 舔 舔 <span ttm:role="x-bg">(呀~)</span></text><text for="L21">姐张开 腿 腿 腿 腿 腿</text><text for="L22">说 这就是你想要的内个</text><text for="L23">天上素个啥？飞过去惹？</text><text for="L24">天上素个啥？飞过去惹？</text><text for="L25">贝塔白白惹，藏不住惹</text><text for="L26">外星人从天而降，“惊喜”来辣</text><text for="L27">他的老二被 UFO 吸走辣</text><text for="L28">他的牛子被 UFO 劫持辣</text><text for="L29">他的火腿直接爽飞天辣</text><text for="L30">姐从没见过这啥贝塔这么能吸</text><text for="L31">他的老二被 UFO 吸走辣</text><text for="L32">他的牛子被 UFO 劫持辣</text><text for="L33">他的老鼠直接爽飞天辣</text><text for="L34">姐从没见过这啥贝塔这么能吸</text><text for="L35">全部吞噬，全部吸入</text><text for="L36">把他们爽糕潮了</text><text for="L37">全部吞噬，全部吸入</text><text for="L38">把他们爽飞天了</text><text for="L39">全部吞噬，全部吸入</text><text for="L40">把他们爽糕潮了</text><text for="L41">全部吞噬，全部吸入</text><text for="L42">把他们爽飞天了</text><text for="L43">前前后后 看得一清二楚</text><text for="L44">姐可不长眼，眼里只剩你完事的“白”光</text><text for="L45">外星级丢豆，爽到你失控</text><text for="L46">给得足狠活，他要的全上</text><text for="L47">来看看，爱液如星辰般闪耀</text><text for="L48">姐喷鼠鼠上了，贝塔水光闪闪</text><text for="L49">如此耀眼，再多看一眼就会爆炸</text><text for="L50">赤身胴体，细腰曲线全靠塑形衣 <span ttm:role="x-bg">(啊~)</span></text><text for="L51">这身姿美味“像”茶，颠覆他的认知 <span ttm:role="x-bg">(啊~)</span></text><text for="L52">让我来服务那条追追，不用任何介绍 <span ttm:role="x-bg">(啊~)</span></text><text for="L53">有钱男人都懂，自然不放过姐的小珍珠 <span ttm:role="x-bg">(啊~)</span></text><text for="L54">这可是姐的魅力所在，只有明白人才会欣赏</text><text for="L55">她看似乖巧，本质却危险</text><text for="L56">在这高度，射出来没人逃得掉</text><text for="L57">这是异星领域，一切都在旋转</text><text for="L58">他把二弟就这么狠狠扎进我的黑洞里配种</text><text for="L59">天上素个啥？飞过去惹？</text><text for="L60">天上素个啥？飞过去惹？</text><text for="L61">贝塔扩张惹，藏不住惹</text><text for="L62">外星人从天而降，“惊喜”来辣</text><text for="L63">他的老二被 UFO 吸走辣</text><text for="L64">他的牛子被 UFO 劫持辣</text><text for="L65">他的火腿直接爽飞天辣</text><text for="L66">姐从没见过这啥贝塔这么能吸</text><text for="L67">他的老二被 UFO 吸走辣</text><text for="L68">他的牛子被 UFO 劫持辣</text><text for="L69">他的老鼠直接爽飞天辣</text><text for="L70">姐从没见过这啥贝塔这么能吸</text><text for="L71">全部吞噬，全部吸入</text><text for="L72">把他们爽糕潮了</text><text for="L73">全部吞噬，全部吸入</text><text for="L74">把他们爽飞天了</text><text for="L75">全部吞噬，全部吸入</text><text for="L76">把他们爽糕潮了</text><text for="L77">全部吞噬，全部吸入</text><text for="L78">把他们爽飞天了</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="02:28.655"><div begin="00:00.200" end="00:13.002" itunes:songPart="Intro"><p begin="00:00.200" end="00:02.914" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:00.200" end="00:00.307">Ba-</span><span begin="00:00.307" end="00:00.403">da-</span><span begin="00:00.403" end="00:00.612">da-</span><span begin="00:00.612" end="00:00.773">da,</span> <span begin="00:00.827" end="00:00.928">ba-</span><span begin="00:00.928" end="00:01.040">da-</span><span begin="00:01.040" end="00:01.173">e-</span><span begin="00:01.211" end="00:01.525">uh,</span> <span begin="00:02.517" end="00:02.622">ba-</span><span begin="00:02.622" end="00:02.727">da-</span><span begin="00:02.727" end="00:02.914">e</span></p><p begin="00:03.576" end="00:06.283" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:03.576" end="00:03.787">Ba,</span> <span begin="00:04.222" end="00:04.323">ba-</span><span begin="00:04.323" end="00:04.425">da-</span><span begin="00:04.425" end="00:04.547">e-</span><span begin="00:04.618" end="00:04.901">uh,</span> <span begin="00:05.360" end="00:05.535">ba,</span> <span begin="00:05.684" end="00:05.833">ba,</span> <span begin="00:05.896" end="00:05.995">ba-</span><span begin="00:05.995" end="00:06.109">da-</span><span begin="00:06.109" end="00:06.283">e</span></p><p begin="00:06.961" end="00:09.689" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:06.961" end="00:07.070">Ba-</span><span begin="00:07.070" end="00:07.179">da-</span><span begin="00:07.179" end="00:07.363">da-</span><span begin="00:07.363" end="00:07.529">da,</span> <span begin="00:07.594" end="00:07.692">ba-</span><span begin="00:07.692" end="00:07.808">da-</span><span begin="00:07.808" end="00:07.938">e-</span><span begin="00:07.990" end="00:08.271">uh,</span> <